{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03184",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 5.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.47,
      "end_seconds": 11.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.01,
      "end_seconds": 24.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.85,
      "text": "It's, It's a high sugar test in pregnancy. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.59,
      "end_seconds": 30.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.68,
      "end_seconds": 43.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "I've had it for two weeks. I just want to get back to normal, um, really. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.93,
      "end_seconds": 48.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.36,
      "end_seconds": 69.88,
      "duration_seconds": 19.52,
      "text": "Erm, about a five out of ten. Oh, and a big baby on the scan. Oh, and no symptoms. That's been about the same, about two weeks. As for no symptoms, it feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.57,
      "end_seconds": 95.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Have you had any thirst, passing a lot of urine, blurred vision or reduced baby movements?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.0,
      "end_seconds": 106.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Erm, I haven't had thirst, passing a lot of urine, blurred vision or reduced baby movements, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.61,
      "end_seconds": 110.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.44,
      "end_seconds": 112.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.4,
      "end_seconds": 120.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.43,
      "end_seconds": 125.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.31,
      "end_seconds": 127.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.79,
      "end_seconds": 143.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.01,
      "end_seconds": 147.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.21,
      "end_seconds": 155.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.77,
      "end_seconds": 157.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.87,
      "end_seconds": 167.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "I follow. Alright, anxiety, that matches what I have here. Okay, what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.98,
      "end_seconds": 175.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.35,
      "end_seconds": 180.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.63,
      "end_seconds": 186.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.79,
      "end_seconds": 189.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.74,
      "end_seconds": 193.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.56,
      "end_seconds": 196.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.58,
      "end_seconds": 203.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.55,
      "end_seconds": 208.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.24,
      "end_seconds": 220.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.79,
      "end_seconds": 242.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 97 percent, heart rate 72, BP is 117 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.89,
      "end_seconds": 244.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.64,
      "end_seconds": 247.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.81,
      "end_seconds": 253.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.8,
      "end_seconds": 256.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.91,
      "end_seconds": 260.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.13,
      "end_seconds": 275.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and your urine has no sugar today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.43,
      "end_seconds": 281.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.76,
      "end_seconds": 296.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards gestational diabetes controllable with diet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.78,
      "end_seconds": 300.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.55,
      "end_seconds": 320.63,
      "duration_seconds": 14.08,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with gestational diabetes controllable with diet do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order a glucose meter and diary, for gestational diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 321.16,
      "end_seconds": 325.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "We have a slot Tuesday at 11:30 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.94,
      "end_seconds": 329.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.17,
      "end_seconds": 351.57,
      "duration_seconds": 21.4,
      "text": "Let's book a growth scan to look into gestational diabetes. Replace sugary drinks and white starches with wholegrains and walk after meals. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'll want another look in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.14,
      "end_seconds": 358.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Right, okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.16,
      "end_seconds": 362.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.57,
      "end_seconds": 366.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}